   "at": "0x14F9B8"
  },
  {
   "op": "draw_text_message_and_wait",
   "flag_word": 14,
   "text_offset": 645,
   "text": "Hi, kids.  Looks like you'll have the place all to yourself.",
   "at": "0x14F9BE"
  },
  {
   "op": "start_anim_sequence_and_wait",
   "channel": 13,
   "seq": 8,
   "at": "0x14F9C6"
  },
  {
   "op": "draw_text_message_and_wait",
   "flag_word": 9,
   "text_offset": 706,
   "text": "Really?  I thought this was a busy time of year.",
   "at": "0x14F9CC"
  },
  {
   "op": "start_anim_sequence_and_wait",
   "channel": 26,
   "seq": 13,
   "at": "0x14F9D4"
  },
  {
   "op": "draw_text_message_and_wait",
   "flag_word": 14,
   "text_offset": 755,
   "text": "It is.  Only this blasted ghost has been scaring off all my customers.",
   "at": "0x14F9DA"
  },
  {
   "op": "start_anim_sequence_and_wait",
   "channel": 26,
   "seq": 13,
   "at": "0x14F9E2"
  },
  {
   "op": "draw_text_message_and_wait",
   "flag_word": 14,
   "text_offset": 826,
   "text": "If this keeps up, I'll be bankrupt!",
   "at": "0x14F9E8"
  },
  {
   "op": "draw_text_message_and_wait",
   "flag_word": 4102,
   "text_offset": 862,
   "text": "G-g-ghost?",
   "at": "0x14F9F0"
  },
  {
   "op": "start_anim_sequence_and_wait",
   "channel": 26,
   "seq": 12,
   "at": "0x14F9F8"
  },
  {
   "op": "draw_text_message_and_wait",
   "flag_word": 14,
   "text_offset": 873,
   "text": "I knew I shouldn't have said anything.",
   "at": "0x14F9FE"
  },
  {
   "op": "start_anim_sequence_and_wait",
   "channel": 13,
   "seq": 9,
   "at": "0x14FA06"
  },
  {
   "op": "draw_text_message_and_wait",
   "flag_word": 9,
   "text_offset": 912,
   "text": "We don't believe in Ghosts, Uncle Blake!",
   "at": "0x14FA0C"
  },
  {
   "op": "draw_text_message_and_wait",
   "flag_word": 4102,
   "text_offset": 953,
   "text": "Speak for yourself, Fred!",
   "at": "0x14FA14"
  },
  {
   "op": "start_anim_sequence_and_wait",
   "channel": 13,
   "seq": 11,
   "at": "0x14FA1C"
  },
  {
   "op": "draw_text_message_and_wait",
   "flag_word": 9,
   "text_offset": 979,
   "text": "Uncle Blake, tell us about this ghost.",
   "at": "0x14FA22"
  },
  {
   "op": "start_anim_sequence_and_wait",
   "channel": 26,
   "seq": 13,
   "at": "0x14FA2A"
  },
  {
   "op": "draw_text_message_and_wait",
   "flag_word": 14,
   "text_offset": 1018,
   "text": "Not much to tell. He showed up about a month ago and started running me broke.",
   "at": "0x14FA30"
  },
  {
   "op": "start_anim_sequence_and_wait",
   "channel": 26,
   "seq": 12,
   "at": "0x14FA38"
  },
  {
   "op": "draw_text_message_and_wait",
   "flag_word": 14,
   "text_offset": 1097,
   "text": "The gardener claims he's the ghost of the Ancient Chieftan.",
   "at": "0x14FA3E"
  },
  {
   "op": "start_anim_sequence_and_wait",
   "channel": 13,
   "seq": 10,
   "at": "0x14FA46"
  },
  {
   "op": "draw_text_message_and_wait",
   "flag_word": 9,
   "text_offset": 1157,
   "text": "Who's the Ancient Chieftan?",
   "at": "0x14FA4C"
  },
  {
   "op": "start_anim_sequence_and_wait",
   "channel": 26,
   "seq": 12,
   "at": "0x14FA54"
  },
  {
   "op": "draw_text_message_and_wait",
   "flag_word": 14,
   "text_offset": 1185,
   "text": "A long time ago, the Indians used this place as a burial ground.",
   "at": "0x14FA5A"
  },
  {
   "op": "start_anim_sequence_and_wait",
   "channel": 26,
   "seq": 13,
   "at": "0x14FA62"
  },
  {
   "op": "draw_text_message_and_wait",
   "flag_word": 4102,
   "text_offset": 1250,
   "text": "You mean like from India?",
   "at": "0x14FA68"
  },
  {
   "op": "start_anim_sequence_and_wait",
   "channel": 14,
   "seq": 4,
   "at": "0x14FA70"
  },
  {
   "op": "draw_text_message_and_wait",
   "flag_word": 29,
   "text_offset": 1276,
   "text": "No, silly. He means Native Americans.",
   "at": "0x14FA76"
  },
  {
   "op": "start_anim_sequence_and_wait",
   "channel": 26,
   "seq": 13,
   "at": "0x14FA7E"
  },
  {
   "op": "draw_text_message_and_wait",
   "flag_word": 14,
   "text_offset": 1314,
   "text": "The Ancient Chieftan was a famous warrior around these parts about two hundred years ago.",
   "at": "0x14FA84"
  },
  {
   "op": "start_anim_sequence_and_wait",
   "channel": 26,
   "seq": 11,
   "at": "0x14FA8C"
  },
  {
   "op": "draw_text_message_and_wait",
   "flag_word": 14,
   "text_offset": 1404,
   "text": "They say he's buried nearby.",
   "at": "0x14FA92"
  },
  {
   "op": "start_anim_sequence_and_wait",
   "channel": 13,
   "seq": 8,
   "at": "0x14FA9A"
  },
  {
   "op": "draw_text_message_and_wait",
   "flag_word": 9,
   "text_offset": 1433,
   "text": "Why would the ghost of the Ancient Chieftan be haunting you?",
   "at": "0x14FAA0"
  },
  {
   "op": "start_anim_sequence_and_wait",
   "channel": 26,
   "seq": 12,
   "at": "0x14FAA8"
  },
  {
   "op": "draw_text_message_and_wait",
   "flag_word": 14,
   "text_offset": 1494,
   "text": "I don't know for certain.",
   "at": "0x14FAAE"
  },
  {
   "op": "start_anim_sequence_and_wait",
   "channel": 26,
   "seq": 13,
   "at": "0x14FAB6"
  },
  {
   "op": "draw_text_message_and_wait",
   "flag_word": 14,
   "text_offset": 1520,
   "text": "But the gardener claims the Chieftan doesn't like his land being used for a hotel.",
   "at": "0x14FABC"
  },
  {
   "op": "start_anim_sequence_and_wait",
   "channel": 13,
   "seq": 11,
   "at": "0x14FAC4"
  },
  {
   "op": "draw_text_message_and_wait",
   "flag_word": 14,
   "text_offset": 1603,
   "text": "What I can't figure out is how come it took so long for him to get mad about it.",
   "at": "0x14FACA"
  },
  {
   "op": "start_anim_sequence_and_wait",
   "channel": 13,
   "seq": 11,
   "at": "0x14FAD2"
  },
  {
   "op": "draw_text_message_and_wait",
   "flag_word": 9,
   "text_offset": 1684,
   "text": "Where was this ghost seen last?",
   "at": "0x14FAD8"
  },
  {
   "op": "start_anim_sequence_and_wait",
   "channel": 26,
   "seq": 12,
   "at": "0x14FAE0"
  },
  {
   "op": "draw_text_message_and_wait",
   "flag_word": 14,
   "text_offset": 1716,
   "text": "The cook saw him across the river just yesterday.",
   "at": "0x14FAE6"
  },
  {
   "op": "start_anim_sequence_and_wait",
   "channel": 13,
   "seq": 11,
   "at": "0x14FAEE"
  },
  {
   "op": "draw_text_message_and_wait",
   "flag_word": 9,
   "text_offset": 1766,
   "text": "Come on, guys. Let's check out that area.",
   "at": "0x14FAF4"
  },
